  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6be890c8a758f3488227c7687955d0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: WallSlideUnlockTaleStone
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaleStoneData
  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "\u0110\u1EEBng e s\u1EE3 nh\u1EEFng v\u1EF1c s\xE2u hun h\xFAt. D\u1EABu
      th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi n\xE0y c\xF3 \xFAa t\xE0n, l\u1EDBp v\u1ECF c\u1EE7a c\u1ED9i
      th\u1EE5 v\u1EABn lu\xF4n ch\xE0o \u0111\xF3n c\xE1i ch\u1EA1m c\u1EE7a con."
    textEN: Do not fear the deep abysses. Though the world fades, the ancient bark
      still welcomes your touch.
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "H\xE3y t\xEC m\xF3ng vu\u1ED1t v\xE0o v\xE1ch \u0111\xE1, t\u0129nh
      t\xE2m c\u1EA3n l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED9 r\u01A1i, v\xE0 \u0111\u1EC3 khu r\u1EEBng
      n\xE2ng \u0111\u1EE1 ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
    textEN: Cling to the walls, steady your descent, and let the forest catch you.
    AutoSkip: 0
  AutoProgressDelay: 1.5
  TypingSpeed: 0.05
  IsActivated: 0
  IsKingMonolith: 0
  IsHeroMonolith: 0
